ranch. Every week you choose how it spends its time: drills, meals, rest, praise. It has a mind of its own. When it does not trust you yet, it ignores your commands mid-fight. Earn its trust and it fights for you. Then take it to the arena. What is in the demo: 50 spirit beasts on the roster, each with its own body, temperament and moves Weekly ranch life: drills, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T15:32:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5118540-1845383656378511","game_id":"steam-5118540","kind":"announcement","title":"Which beast would you raise first? Demo arrives 6 October","summary":"Which spirit beast would you raise first? On 6 October you get to find out. The free demo of Linwu: Spirit Beast Ranch arrives on Steam that day. Summon a spirit beast at the Shrine and bring it home to your ranch. Every week you choose how it spends its time: drills, meals, rest, praise. It has a mind of its own. When it does not trust you yet, it ignores your commands mid-fight. Earn its trust and it fights for you. Then take it to the arena. What is in the demo: 50 spirit beasts on the roster","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T17:43:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378511","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5118540-1842846814442687","game_id":"steam-5118540","kind":"announcement","title":"37 spirit beasts. Which one would you raise first?","summary":"There are 37 of them, and you raise one at a time. Linwu: Spirit Beast Ranch is a monster-raising game in the spirit of the ones we grew up on. Pick your beast, then make it yours. Drills, meals, rest, praise. Swim it across a lake, send it up a mountain, feed it the fish it likes. It has a mind of its own. When it does not trust you yet, it ignores your commands mid-fight. Some weeks it refuses a cup outright, like a kid refusing to go to school. Earn its trust and it fights for you. Then take ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T09:05:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442687","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5118540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:24:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:24:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5118540":"2026-10-26T08:24:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5118540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:24:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:24:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:24:07Z"},"5276010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:24:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:24:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:24:07Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5118540","app_id":5118540,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:32Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c9dedc0288b839dd82e90e64a38341e8bc7e85b6da66483a9a6bf9e6de501cba","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Summon a spirit beast, raise it week by week, and take it up the tournament cups. It has a mind of its own, and every choice shapes how long you get together. A monster-raising sim drawn from Chinese myth. Free demo out now.","publishers":[{"name":"Linveil Ga